1
00:00:05,004 --> 00:00:10,009
TRADITIONAL COMING-OF-AGE CEREMONY

2
00:00:19,101 --> 00:00:20,853
<i>Geupgyechinyeo</i>.

3
00:00:20,937 --> 00:00:22,563
<i>Sinsimjeongjeong</i>.

4
00:00:23,064 --> 00:00:25,691
<i>Jijoyugyeon. Seongyeochideok.</i>

5
00:00:26,567 --> 00:00:29,362
You have finally reached the age
to wear a <i>binyeo</i>.

6
00:00:29,737 --> 00:00:32,657
Keep your body and mind
upright and chaste.

7
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:35,493
Keep your will and integrity firm.

8
00:00:35,576 --> 00:00:39,247
You must embody the virtues
of womanhood.

9
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:45,753
<i>This </i>binyeo

10
00:00:46,087 --> 00:00:48,047
<i>represents the responsibilities</i>
<i>you hold</i>

11
00:00:48,256 --> 00:00:50,049
<i>as a woman.</i>

12
00:00:51,634 --> 00:00:54,053
<i>From now on</i>

13
00:00:54,470 --> 00:00:57,098
<i>you must carry your body and mind</i>
<i>with dignity and care.</i>

14
00:00:57,974 --> 00:00:59,850
<i>Don't make yourself look easy.</i>

15
00:01:00,184 --> 00:01:02,061
<i>Don't give in too quickly.</i>

16
00:01:02,895 --> 00:01:04,814
<i>Valuing yourself is</i>

17
00:01:05,690 --> 00:01:07,233
<i>what gives you dignity as a woman.</i>

18
00:01:08,317 --> 00:01:09,360
<i>Do you understand?</i>

19
00:01:10,403 --> 00:01:13,781
<i>The </i>binyeo <i>my mother had pressed down</i>
<i>on my head all my life.</i>

20
00:01:14,156 --> 00:01:18,077
<i>It took me 29 years</i>
<i>to finally remove it.</i>

21
00:04:09,248 --> 00:04:12,835
<i>When one falls in love,</i>
<i>a lot happens in the brain.</i>

22
00:04:15,838 --> 00:04:17,882
Shrimp? Chicken?

23
00:04:17,965 --> 00:04:21,302
<i>One's judgment becomes paralyzed</i>
<i>and passion starts to surge.</i>

24
00:04:23,012 --> 00:04:26,265
I'll have one salmon sandwich
and one hot cafe latte, please.

25
00:04:26,348 --> 00:04:29,393
Okay. One salmon and latte?

26
00:04:29,477 --> 00:04:31,145
Anything else?

27
00:04:31,228 --> 00:04:33,189
No, wait.
Maybe chicken will be better?

28
00:04:33,647 --> 00:04:35,691
Is there avocado
in the chicken sandwich too?

29
00:04:35,775 --> 00:04:37,777
That's extra. Do you want to add it?

30
00:04:37,860 --> 00:04:39,153
No, I'll go with the original.

31
00:04:47,369 --> 00:04:49,538
<i>When our brains and nervous systems</i>
<i>are activated</i>

32
00:04:49,622 --> 00:04:52,500
<i>they assign a positive value</i>
<i>to the other person.</i>

33
00:04:53,334 --> 00:04:57,171
<i>We find the other person appealing</i>
<i>and sexually dazzling as a result.</i>

34
00:04:58,839 --> 00:05:00,966
<i>Dopamine, serotonin</i>

35
00:05:01,050 --> 00:05:03,427
<i>phenylethylamine, and oxytocin.</i>

36
00:05:04,053 --> 00:05:07,556
<i>All these hormones are activated</i>
<i>in an instant.</i>

37
00:05:08,349 --> 00:05:11,519
<i>We call that love.</i>

38
00:05:20,611 --> 00:05:23,405
Ms. Gong, are you up?

39
00:05:44,677 --> 00:05:46,595
I HAD A GOOD TIME!

40
00:06:17,459 --> 00:06:22,256
MAKE ME TINGLE

41
