57
00:07:02,630 --> 00:07:04,214
So is that a yes?

58
00:07:04,298 --> 00:07:05,966
Well...

59
00:07:08,761 --> 00:07:09,929
Yes?

60
00:07:10,846 --> 00:07:12,348
What? Really?

61
00:07:12,431 --> 00:07:15,809
Well, as long as both parties agree

62
00:07:15,893 --> 00:07:17,478
