63
00:07:17,561 --> 00:07:19,980
You could say I respect
the diversity of relationships.

64
00:07:21,315 --> 00:07:23,943
I didn't know how cool you were.
Mr. Dokgo, what about you?

65
00:07:24,026 --> 00:07:25,736
Of course.

66
00:07:25,819 --> 00:07:27,363
It's all about having a good time,
isn't it?

67
00:07:27,905 --> 00:07:29,031
As long as they had a good time.

68
00:07:30,074 --> 00:07:31,909
Right.

69
00:07:31,992 --> 00:07:33,035
Right. That's what matters.

70
00:07:33,243 --> 00:07:35,245
