86
00:08:14,201 --> 00:08:15,786
He's not the only one
whose pride is hurt.

87
00:08:15,869 --> 00:08:17,496
My pride is hurt too.

88
00:08:24,878 --> 00:08:26,714
This is nice and neat.

89
00:08:32,970 --> 00:08:34,138
Still

90
00:08:35,723 --> 00:08:39,768
