91
00:08:40,310 --> 00:08:42,187
<i>Maybe he thought</i>
<i>he was being a gentleman.</i>

92
00:08:42,271 --> 00:08:43,480
<i>In case you'd be embarrassed.</i>

93
00:08:43,772 --> 00:08:44,982
<i>It makes sense to me.</i>

94
00:08:45,065 --> 00:08:48,569
You said it was absurd
when that younger boy ran away.

95
00:08:48,652 --> 00:08:50,487
<i>Come on. We're not the same.</i>

96
00:08:50,571 --> 00:08:52,531
<i>You two work together.</i>

97
00:08:54,408 --> 00:08:55,743
