"Not bad"?

108
00:09:19,975 --> 00:09:22,186
That doesn't sound right.

109
00:09:22,853 --> 00:09:25,064
<i>Then how about this? FWB.</i>

110
00:09:25,147 --> 00:09:27,691
- F what?
<i>- Friends with benefits.</i>

111
00:09:27,775 --> 00:09:30,611
