119
00:10:35,968 --> 00:10:37,219
Did you like it?

120
00:10:38,428 --> 00:10:40,639
Come on. Stop asking.

121
00:10:40,722 --> 00:10:41,849
Tell me. How was it?

122
00:10:41,932 --> 00:10:45,102
