130
00:11:13,839 --> 00:11:16,258
Fold your finger
if you can't stop thinking about him.

131
00:11:16,341 --> 00:11:18,385
- What?
- Fold it.

132
00:11:18,927 --> 00:11:21,263
- Happy now?
- If your heart pounds around him

133
00:11:21,346 --> 00:11:23,182
- fold it.
