142
00:12:04,765 --> 00:12:06,642
By the way, what about Yeon-su?

143
00:12:07,017 --> 00:12:08,185
Did she say anything?

144
00:12:08,268 --> 00:12:10,395
- What do you mean?
- I mean

145
00:12:10,729 --> 00:12:14,858
