but she didn't say anything about it.

146
00:12:15,567 --> 00:12:17,986
By the way, Baek-hee.
Who do you prefer?

147
00:12:18,445 --> 00:12:19,446
First one?

148
00:12:20,364 --> 00:12:21,406
Second one?

149
00:12:22,282 --> 00:12:23,867
Above all

150
00:12:23,951 --> 00:12:26,328
