He was sexy, but...

153
00:12:32,251 --> 00:12:35,295
the problem was
that other women found him sexy too.

154
00:12:36,797 --> 00:12:39,925
All a man needs to do is
take care of his woman.

155
00:12:40,384 --> 00:12:42,386
A man who takes good care
of his woman

156
00:12:42,761 --> 00:12:44,221
also takes good care of his family.

157
00:12:45,180 --> 00:12:47,474
And healthy.

158
00:12:51,812 --> 00:12:53,730
I mean

159
00:12:53,814 --> 00:12:56,692
