good dumplings these days.

160
00:12:56,775 --> 00:12:58,443
Why waste expensive labor on this?

161
00:12:58,527 --> 00:13:02,489
Let me grab more kimchi filling.

162
00:13:05,075 --> 00:13:06,743
I liked him.

163
00:13:10,330 --> 00:13:12,249
He reminded me of you
when you were young.

164
00:13:29,391 --> 00:13:31,351
I'll take the next one.

165
00:13:32,853 --> 00:13:34,563
- There's enough room.
- What?

166
00:13:40,819 --> 00:13:42,070
Did you enjoy your lunch?

167
00:13:42,863 --> 00:13:44,573
Oh, yes.

168
00:14:01,923 --> 00:14:05,635
<i>He might actually be doing it</i>
<i>just for fun.</i>

169
00:14:06,345 --> 00:14:07,512
<i>Is that okay with you?</i>

170
