178
00:14:33,455 --> 00:14:34,748
There he goes again.

179
00:14:34,831 --> 00:14:37,793
He's after the discount coupons
every quarter, so he's protesting.

180
00:14:37,876 --> 00:14:41,046
- Don't worry about it.
- But

181
00:14:41,129 --> 00:14:43,256
