to blackmail and threats.

182
00:14:43,340 --> 00:14:44,841
He really crossed the line.

183
00:14:44,925 --> 00:14:48,303
He said he'd set the company on fire.

184
00:14:48,387 --> 00:14:51,181
He'd grab the CEO by the collar.
And he'd...

185
00:14:52,808 --> 00:14:55,143
- That's not good.
- What? What else did he say?

186
00:14:55,227 --> 00:14:58,980
He'd damage a certain part...

187
00:14:59,689 --> 00:15:02,067
- What?
- He said he'd cut it.

188
00:15:04,778 --> 00:15:05,821
Cut what?

189
00:15:06,947 --> 00:15:08,782
It's Peter Pan T.
He's starting again.

190
00:15:08,865 --> 00:15:10,575
Yeon-su seems worried about you.

191
00:15:14,454 --> 00:15:16,039
- Worried?
- My desk is

192
00:15:16,123 --> 00:15:17,833
the closest to the entrance.

193
00:15:18,583 --> 00:15:20,794
If he really shows up

194
00:15:20,877 --> 00:15:23,088
I'd be his first target.

195
00:15:23,171 --> 00:15:25,674
But there's something you're good at.

196
00:15:26,550 --> 00:15:27,759
Like...

197
